dev_10_step_reasons: stopped by me at alpha_c ~3.1 (SIGTERM own PIDs 17025 17023 17017 ), reason found: the refused steps had scaled residuals of 2e-27 to 3e-27 (<= 1e-24, the declared bar) but Newton's own flag converged=false (tol 1e-28), which step_family also required; A2 declares only fnorm <= 1e-24 and |dlnk| <= 0.25.
